  "changes": [
    "Ownership-proved combined recovery capture from frozen HD/account/Qi/payment journals and retained owned addresses",
    "Preserves all burned HD and payment cursors, completed exposures, account nonce floors, exact both-ledger claims and candidate payloads",
    "Payment receive exposure proves mixed-input Qi custody from the retained seed without separately exporting a child private key",
    "Existing authenticated QUAIWALT v1-v5 format unchanged; restore initializes new allocators above burned floors",
    "Rejects duplicate namespaces, mismatched owners, cross-ledger operation-ID collisions and bounds"
